        <mxCell id="microvm" value="&lt;b&gt;AWS Lambda MicroVM (Linux ARM64)&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;service-managed — not inside the VPC&#xa;&#xa;• Claude Code (terminal)&#xa;• VS Code Server + tunnel host&#xa;• /workspace&#xa;&#xa;egress only via the scoped VPC connector" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF3E6;strokeColor=#ED7100;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=14;verticalAlign=middle;" parent="1" vertex="1">
