            </Array>
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Flows&lt;/b&gt;  1–4 create and control an environment (blue) • 5 terminal session • 6 VS Code session (teal) • 7–8 model and workspace traffic (orange) • dashed = supporting path&#xa;Only connector ENIs, VPC endpoints, and the NAT Gateway reside in the VPC; the API icon combines the execute-api endpoint with its private REST API. Other service icons are outside customer subnets.&#xa;All MicroVM traffic leaves through the scoped VPC connector: private AWS destinations use VPC endpoints; Microsoft tunnels and public HTTPS exit through the NAT Gateway." style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#232F3E;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=4;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1010" width="1560" height="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
